    "detailed_description": "PUCK RUNNER is a challenging endless runner inspired by air hockey. Physically hit the puck to with your mouse to avoid obstacles, with your control of the puck being constantly threatened by ever-increasing speed and complexity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TACTILE GAMEPLAY</h2>Everything in-game from the puck, obstacles and even the mouse is a physics object with tactile, satisfying interactions and sounds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TIME MANIPULATION</h2>Puck Runner is simple to learn but tough to master, with a very high skill ceiling, Collecting energy allows you to slow down time to alllow you to regain control if you're in a tight spot, or speed up time to reach greater distances faster.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STEAM LEADERBOARDS</h2>Compare your best distances and speeds with your friends and the community on Steam. Can you beat the rest?",
